{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_010","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click the Manager button in the ComfyUI interface","location_hint":"paragraph 85","char_start":1852,"char_end":1901,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_011","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click the Manager button on the main menu (top bar).","location_hint":"paragraph 86","char_start":1903,"char_end":1955,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_012","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Browse or search for the node you want to install","location_hint":"paragraph 90","char_start":1999,"char_end":2048,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_013","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click **Install** to install the node","location_hint":"paragraph 92","char_start":2061,"char_end":2098,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_014","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Prefer latest version if available","location_hint":"paragraph 93","char_start":2102,"char_end":2136,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_015","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click Select to install the node","location_hint":"paragraph 94","char_start":2138,"char_end":2170,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_016","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Version numbers with digits are versions published by authors to registry , equivalent to stable releases","location_hint":"paragraph 95","char_start":2178,"char_end":2283,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_017","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"nightly is the latest version updated by authors to github, equivalent to development version, usually not security scanned, with unstable factors","location_hint":"paragraph 96","char_start":2285,"char_end":2431,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_018","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"ComfyUI’s default security settings do not allow direct installation of nightly versions. You can refer to Security Policy for details","location_hint":"paragraph 97","char_start":2433,"char_end":2567,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_019","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Wait for dependency installation to complete, then restart ComfyUI","location_hint":"paragraph 99","char_start":2578,"char_end":2644,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_020","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"After clicking install, Manager will automatically complete dependency installation and prompt you to restart ComfyUI after installation is complete","location_hint":"paragraph 100","char_start":2646,"char_end":2794,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_021","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Check if the plugin was installed successfully","location_hint":"paragraph 102","char_start":2805,"char_end":2851,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_022","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"After restarting, check in ComfyUI Manager whether the corresponding plugin was installed successfully, and whether there are import failed error messages","location_hint":"paragraph 103","char_start":2853,"char_end":3007,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_023","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Missing nodes are a common situation when loading workflows. There are usually two types of missing nodes:","location_hint":"paragraph 106","char_start":3039,"char_end":3145,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_024","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Core node missing: ComfyUI version is not the latest version, please refer to Update ComfyUI to update ComfyUI","location_hint":"paragraph 107","char_start":3148,"char_end":3258,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_025","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Custom node missing: Third-party custom nodes are missing, you can refer to this guide for installation","location_hint":"paragraph 108","char_start":3260,"char_end":3363,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_026","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"After ComfyUI-Manager is installed, if there are missing custom nodes when importing workflows, you will be alerted about the missing node information","location_hint":"paragraph 109","char_start":3366,"char_end":3516,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_027","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click Open Manager to activate the corresponding option","location_hint":"paragraph 110","char_start":3520,"char_end":3575,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_028","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"2. Click Install Missing Custom Nodes in the Manager menu to enter the missing nodes list interface","location_hint":"paragraph 111","char_start":3579,"char_end":3678,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_029","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"3. View and install the corresponding nodes in the node list","location_hint":"paragraph 112","char_start":3680,"char_end":3740,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_030","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"If you find that the missing nodes list cannot find the corresponding node, there are usually several situations:","location_hint":"paragraph 113","char_start":3744,"char_end":3857,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_031","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"The corresponding node author has not submitted and registered the custom node to registry","location_hint":"paragraph 114","char_start":3859,"char_end":3949,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_032","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"The corresponding node is not open source, it may be a restricted node from certain authors or limited platforms","location_hint":"paragraph 115","char_start":3951,"char_end":4063,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_033","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"The original author changed the version and deleted the corresponding node","location_hint":"paragraph 116","char_start":4065,"char_end":4139,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_034","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Switch the filter to Update filter to filter nodes that can be updated in the current node list","location_hint":"paragraph 119","char_start":4167,"char_end":4262,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_035","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Click the Update button to update the node","location_hint":"paragraph 120","char_start":4264,"char_end":4306,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_036","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Select the “Installed” filter in the node list to filter installed nodes in the current node list","location_hint":"paragraph 123","char_start":4337,"char_end":4434,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_037","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Right-click the corresponding node and select Uninstall to uninstall","location_hint":"paragraph 124","char_start":4436,"char_end":4504,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_038","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Uninstalling the corresponding node will not remove the corresponding dependency installation","location_hint":"paragraph 125","char_start":4508,"char_end":4601,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_039","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"For other methods of installing plugins, please refer to the article below","location_hint":"paragraph 126","char_start":4603,"char_end":4677,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_040","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Learn how to manually install custom nodes","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":4705,"char_end":4747,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_041","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Snapshots save your current installation status, allowing you to restore to a previous state.","location_hint":"paragraph 131","char_start":4774,"char_end":4867,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_042","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Snapshots are automatically saved when you press Save snapshot or use Update All . Snapshot files are stored in: <USER_DIRECTORY>/default/ComfyUI-Manager/snapshots\nTo restore: Open the Snapshot Manager, select a snapshot, and press Restore .","location_hint":"paragraph 132","char_start":4869,"char_end":5110,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_043","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"Restoration takes effect on the next ComfyUI startup. For custom nodes not managed by Git, snapshot support is incomplete.","location_hint":"paragraph 133","char_start":5114,"char_end":5236,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e7045b6bccdb_044","source_id":"src_e7045b6bccdb","source_hash":"73e74237f98d84fdedcbc9728029423fe8d1089b9968cdf4803d604f4464c146","text":"installation Tutorials Development","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":5420,"char_end":5454,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:36:20.292Z"}
